docs {
  ## POST /api/retailer/widget-key/:service

  Rotates (regenerates) the public widget API key for a specific service.

  > ⚠️ **Destructive:** The old key is immediately invalidated.  
  > Any `<script>` embed or storefront code using the old key will start failing.
  > Update your embed snippet after rotating.

  ### Path Params — Valid Services
  `RECOMMENDATION`, `VTON_2D`, `BODY_MODELING`

  ### Authentication
  Requires a logged-in, **activated** retailer session cookie.
  Pending/suspended accounts receive `403`.

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  { "apiKey": "mk_pub_newkeyxxxxxxxxxx" }
  ```
}
